graph TB
    Q["query text, k, optional law filter"] --> R{"which Retriever<br/>(same Hit protocol, interchangeable)"}
    R --> LEX["LexicalRetriever: FTS5 bm25,<br/>tokenized query"]
    R --> DEN["dense: embed query, cosine search<br/>QdrantRetriever (embedded Qdrant, law filter in Qdrant)<br/>or DenseRetriever (numpy matrix)"]
    R --> HYB["HybridRetriever: lexical pool 50 + dense pool 50<br/>-> RRF fusion (rrf_k 60) -> top k"]
    R --> RR["RerankedRetriever: base pool 30<br/>-> Reranker (local model) or ServerReranker (:8081) -> top k"]
    LEX --> HIT["Hit: chunk id, ref (dieu/khoan), text, score<br/>text always from the SQLite KB"]
    DEN --> HIT
    HYB --> HIT
    RR --> HIT
